@name     control_event_bind
@alias    /ceb
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_control_event_bind
@type     immediate
@arity    2
@match    (finite, finite)
@summary  bind control event to Skode command
@doc
Binds control event (type, id) to execute Skode code string.
Usage: [command] /ceb type id
@code
    return skode_exec_slashceb(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
